{"1446890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shadow Fight Arena", "steam_appid": 1446890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PVP FIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in exciting ranked fights against other players. Improve your skills, level up your Heroes, and move up the Leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/2afc309def2725e128b435ea780e2759.poster.avif?t=1783547754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/2afc309def2725e128b435ea780e2759.webm?t=1783547754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTRAORDINARY HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter both old friends from the Shadow Fight universe and brand new characters. A charismatic demon, an experienced samurai, a queen of the criminal world, or a shadow bot — every player will find their favorite among dozens of unique Heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/0aa60ed16e2b9afd8761cf466f598776.poster.avif?t=1783547754\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/0aa60ed16e2b9afd8761cf466f598776.webm?t=1783547754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIETY OF COMBAT STYLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Hero has their own style and abilities. As you level up, you unlock special talents for your Heroes, allowing you to actively experiment with tactics and strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/896a2ac7a8e669f85a3b36c9e9104406.poster.avif?t=1783547754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/896a2ac7a8e669f85a3b36c9e9104406.webm?t=1783547754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stories is a PvE mode that provides a great opportunity to dive deeper into the world of Shadow Fight. You can learn more about your favorite Heroes in a rogue-like style. It's also a great way to take a break after intense ranked battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/b0f851cea18e4c96fd75b4a9b9545c9c.poster.avif?t=1783547754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/b0f851cea18e4c96fd75b4a9b9545c9c.webm?t=1783547754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DUELS WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can always challenge a friend to an online duel. It's a great way to practice or find out who's the best!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>APPEARANCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skins for Heroes, weapons, fighting stances, taunts, victory poses, and even phrase packs. You will stand out!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>..AND MUCH MORE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special events, themed tournaments, motivational marathons, fun temporary modes — there will be no time for boredom. Join Shadow Fight Arena and Keep fighting! </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PVP FIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in exciting ranked fights against other players. Improve your skills, level up your Heroes, and move up the Leaderboard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/2afc309def2725e128b435ea780e2759.poster.avif?t=1783547754\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/2afc309def2725e128b435ea780e2759.webm?t=1783547754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXTRAORDINARY HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter both old friends from the Shadow Fight universe and brand new characters. A charismatic demon, an experienced samurai, a queen of the criminal world, or a shadow bot — every player will find their favorite among dozens of unique Heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/0aa60ed16e2b9afd8761cf466f598776.poster.avif?t=1783547754\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/extras/0aa60ed16e2b9afd8761cf466f598776.webm?t=1783547754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIETY OF COMBAT STYLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Hero has their own style and abilities. As you level up, you unlock special talents for your Heroes, allowing you to actively experiment with tactics and strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_im