ing game in which you will take part in an epic Shadow Tournament. Choose your Hero and prove what you are capable of!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Vietnamese, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Japanese, Indonesian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/448d89171179e1374d08532eed687b117ecc6e61/header.jpg?t=1783547754", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/406ef02fbd176d121385b666086981cc32c9533c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783547754", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1446890/406ef02fbd176d121385b666086981cc32c9533c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783547754", "website": "https://shadowfight.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Celeron N4000 | AMD A6-9220<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GT 430 | AMD Radeon HD 8760<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Motherboard Integrated sound card (DirectX 9.0c compatible sound card)</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8300H  | Ryzen 5 3550H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1050 | AMD RX 560/RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Stor